#: ../folio-assistant-core/processes/library/ingest-build-l1-kg.bpmn:29
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Build the L1 knowledge graph from what ingestion derived: Dublin Core, the manifest, the assets, their binding and their links. folio-assistant — Ingestion subprocess — build the L1 knowledge graph. Source of truth: this file. Open it in bpmn.io, Camunda Modeler, or any other BPMN 2.0 tool. The SVG under docs/assets/img/workflows/ is generated from it by `bun run cat render:bpmn` — never hand-edit the SVG. The <bootstrap.processes:skill> extension on an activity names the folio-assistant skill that implements it; <cat-harness.processes:bean> marks a step that reads or writes the shared work plan in beans/."
