#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "One standalone Dublin Core record per folder. dcterms is already this corpus's JSON-LD vocabulary, so this extends a live context rather than introducing one."
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/processes/library/ingest-build-l1-kg.bpmn:100
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Owner, 2026-11-01 (folio-assistant-core#498, Q-GLO-1 C): the source's glossary and abbreviations sections become candidate terms of a folio-glossary/v1 scheme with the Tool glossary-from-source, verbatim, each with source file#line, and an acronym as the notation of the term it expands. Terms a person owns are never changed, and only a person moves a term to authored. A source with no such section skips this step with nothing written."
msgstr ""

